  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">틸<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">어<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">어<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZOCqUC9a7wM?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏烏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">어ˉ어ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落雨<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롷허ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thḭ̂ ōr-ôr bêh-loh-hōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">阿公仔<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">아ˉ겅ˉ아`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攑<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鋤頭<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">듸ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">掘<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">굳-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">芋<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">어ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ā-kōng-à giah-ti-tháu bêh-kut-ōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">掘<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">굳ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-s