-space: nowrap\">真正<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">진ˉ쟐`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">趣味<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">추`삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ī-yah-heh-tōr jīn-jià̰-chù-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">阿公仔<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">아ˉ겅ˉ아`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煮<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">주ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鹹<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ā-kōng-à bêh-jû-kiám\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">阿媽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">아ˉ마`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-sp